negative amounts (`-$2` → “$2 will be subtracted”), empty save no‑op, category/unnamed expense save & delete, Recurrent payment toggle, draft retention across dismiss/rotate (portrait↔landscape kept `$12.31`), Analytics cross‑check of total spent.\n\nStill untested when the device died: rapid multi‑key input, very long values, and pill recomputation after an actually applied budget/period edit."}
